{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Sally Gets a Job at a Magazine", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Accepting a Job Offer", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 2, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 16, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "A2.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Describe characteristics of different people and their jobs.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations. ", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": " The First Conditional ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You can use the first conditional to talk about possible actions and situations in the future.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "There are two parts to the sentence.<br/><br/>  One part is the <span class=\"strong\">condition</span>. The other part is the <span class=\"strong\">result</span>. <br/><br/>Form:<br/> <span class=\"italic\">If</span>* + <span class=\"italic\">subject</span> + <span class=\"italic\">Simple Present tense</span>  + <span class=\"italic\">subject</span> + <span class=\"italic\">will/won't</span><br/>You use a comma after the condition in this form.<br/><br/>  *You can use other words instead of <span class=\"italic\">if</span>. You can use <span class=\"italic\">before</span>, <span class=\"italic\">after</span> or <span class=\"italic\">when</span>. These are words we use with future time clauses.<br/><br/>  You can flip the two parts of the sentence so that the result comes first. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Before you come to the front desk,</span><br/><br/>  <span class=\\\"italic\\\">After your interview,</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">you'll have to call.</span><br/><br/>   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">you will want to get your ID card!</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Result\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Condition\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">You'll need to get your access card</span><br/><br/>   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">You may send them an e-mail</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">when you come!</span><br/><br/>   <span class=\\\"italic\\\">if you have any questions.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": " Expressing Opinions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " You use these expressions to express an opinion:", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "<span class=\"italic\">I think \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">In my opinion \u2026</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">I believe that ...</span><br/> <span class=\"italic\">As far as I'm concerned \u2026</span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I think coming in the morning is easy. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "In my opinion, the afternoons are busy. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "As far as we're concerned, you are a great fit for our team.", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "fit", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the way in which a person matches with something else ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We believe that you will be a great fit to our magazine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": " These are words you use to talk about work and jobs. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "publication", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a magazine, paper, etc., that is printed and made available to the public ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: You will be a part of our publication's staff. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "freelancer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who works independently for a company  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I was hired as a freelancer.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to join", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to become a member ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I would love to join your team.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to transfer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to connect someone who has called you to someone else's phone  ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verb)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: He transferred me over to the front desk.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "receptionist", "type": "name"}, {"content": "a person who talks to people arriving at an office and answers the phone ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: The receptionist booked me in for a session.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02aud06", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "meet and greet", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an event where a new employee goes and meets other people who work in the office ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I called the receptionist to book in my meet and greet with the company. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn5le16ob02aud07", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Write a dialogue (10-12 lines) between a manager and a new employee.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Pretend you are the manager. You are going to call the new employee and offer them a job.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Share your opinion with them. Use the first conditional.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Read your dialogue aloud with a partner.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I write about jobs and work.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share an opinion.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I talk about possible actions in the future. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn5le16ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: Hello, Sally? This is Mr. Gold. I'm calling from Cambridge Life about your interview.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Ah, Mr. Gold. How are you?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: I'm well, thanks. We believe that you will be a great fit to our publication. If this position is still of interest to you, you will join our team as a freelancer.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Of course! I would love to."}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob02re2img01.jpg", "time": "23000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: Fantastic. You will need to send an e-mail to HR so that they can get you all set up and  attend a meet and greet. I'll transfer you over to the receptionist.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: OK. Thank you.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Mr. Gold</span>: Please hold for a moment.<br/>"}, {"image": "engenn5le16ob02re2img02.jpg", "time": "39500", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Hi, Ms. Davis?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Yes.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: You're able to come in at anytime, correct?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: That's correct.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: Hmm. OK. You'll need to get a pass when you come. You'll need to do that before your meet and greet. In my opinion, the morning would be easier. It's not as busy.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Alright.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Receptionist</span>: I'm booking you in for 9:30 a.m. on Monday. Come in 45 minutes early."}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le16ob02re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le16ob02re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "  I can talk about jobs and work. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": "I can talk about cause and effect.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can introduce an opinion. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Where would you like to work when you are older? ", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What would your dream job be?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " It's time to accept a job offer with Sally. What's the job?", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "  Sally gets a call from the magazine. Who's it from?", "type": "text"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"